hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18007","Jarir narrated to us from Mansur from Mujahid from Abu al-Hakam, or al-Hakam ibn Sufyan al-Thaqafi, he said: I saw the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) urinate, then perform ablution and sprinkle water upon his private part."
"18008","Aswad ibn Amir narrated to us, he said: Sharik said: I asked the family of al-Hakam ibn Sufyan, and they mentioned that he did not meet the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him)."
"18009","Yahya ibn Said narrated to us from Sufyan, he said: Mansur narrated to me, and Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi said: Sufyan and Zaidah narrated to us from Mansur from Mujahid from a man from Thaqif, he is al-Hakam ibn Sufyan or Sufyan ibn al-Hakam, Abd al-Rahman said in his hadith: I saw the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) urinate and perform ablution and sprinkle his private part with water."
"18010","Abdullah said: I found in my father's book in his handwriting: Yala ibn Ubayd narrated to us, he said: Sufyan narrated to us from Mansur from Mujahid from al-Hakam ibn Sufyan or Sufyan ibn al-Hakam, he said: I saw the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) urinate, meaning then perform ablution, then sprinkle upon his private part."
